 - **`[Column]`** opens the next column of a side-by-side band; each one adds a column, left-to-right. Content declared *before* the first `[Column]` renders full-width above the band. `[Column(2f)]` gives a column twice the width share of a plain `[Column]`.
 - **`[Section("Name")]`** opens a boxed group inside the current column. Controls before any section fall into an anonymous, header-less group.
 - **`[SameLine]`** packs a control onto the previous control's line.
